      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "Compared with languages like English or Spanish, there’s less available source data in Welsh for AI training. So to create a sufficiently large Welsh training dataset, the team used NVIDIA NIM microservices for gpt-oss-120b and DeepSeek-R1 to translate NVIDIA Nemotron open datasets with over 30 million entries from English to Welsh.",
