      "article_id": "article_9706f1c4881eb3a0",
      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "They used a GPU cluster through the NVIDIA DGX Cloud Lepton platform and are harnessing hundreds of NVIDIA GH200 Grace Hopper Superchips on Isambard-AI — the U.K.’s most powerful supercomputer, backed by £225 million in government investment and based at University of Bristol — to accelerate their translation and training workloads.",
